arguments.prompt:
You are implementing features for a Blazor Web App (Interactive WebAssembly, Global, with Individual auth) at `/tmp/sv-4c8ebe26b2064cfca113c42dfd372106/ShipmentTracker/`.

The project structure is:
- `ShipmentTracker/` - Server project  
- `ShipmentTracker.Client/` - WebAssembly client project

## Requirements
- Dispatchers view a list of shipments with status and destination
- Customers check their shipment status and estimated delivery
- Every page has interactive controls
- Authentication is already scaffolded (ASP.NET Core Identity)

## Architecture (WebAssembly Global)
Since this is WebAssembly global mode:
- All interactive components MUST go in the `.Client` project
- Data access from components goes through HttpClient → server API endpoints
- Define interfaces in `.Client`, implement with HttpClient in `.Client`, implement with direct data in server
- Register services in both Program.cs files

## Tasks

### 1. Create shared models in Client project

Create `ShipmentTracker.Client/Models/Shipment.cs`:
```csharp
namespace ShipmentTracker.Client.Models;

public enum ShipmentStatus
{
    Pending,
    PickedUp,
    InTransit,
    OutForDelivery,
    Delivered,
    Delayed
}

public class Shipment
{
    public int Id { get; set; }
    public string TrackingNumber { get; set; } = string.Empty;
    public string Origin { get; set; } = string.Empty;
    public string Destination { get; set; } = string.Empty;
    public ShipmentStatus Status { get; set; }
    public DateTime ShippedDate { get; set; }
    public DateTime EstimatedDelivery { get; set; }
    public DateTime? ActualDelivery { get; set; }
    public string RecipientName { get; set; } = string.Empty;
    public string CarrierName { get; set; } = string.Empty;
    public double WeightKg { get; set; }
}
```

### 2. Create service interface in Client project

Create `ShipmentTracker.Client/Services/IShipmentService.cs`:
```csharp
namespace ShipmentTracker.Client.Services;

using ShipmentTracker.Client.Models;

public interface IShipmentService
{
    Task<List<Shipment>> GetAllShipmentsAsync();
    Task<List<Shipment>> GetShipmentsByStatusAsync(ShipmentStatus? status);
    Task<Shipment?> GetShipmentByTrackingNumberAsync(string trackingNumber);
    Task UpdateShipmentStatusAsync(int id, ShipmentStatus newStatus);
}
```

### 3. Create HttpClient-based implementation in Client project

Create `ShipmentTracker.Client/Services/ShipmentService.cs`:
```csharp
using System.Net.Http.Json;
using ShipmentTracker.Client.Models;

namespace ShipmentTracker.Client.Services;

public class ShipmentService : IShipmentService
{
    private readonly HttpClient _http;

    public ShipmentService(HttpClient http) => _http = http;

    public async Task<List<Shipment>> GetAllShipmentsAsync() =>
        await _http.GetFromJsonAsync<List<Shipment>>("api/shipments") ?? [];

    public async Task<List<Shipment>> GetShipmentsByStatusAsync(ShipmentStatus? status)
    {
        var url = status.HasValue ? $"api/shipments?status={status}" : "api/shipments";
        return await _http.GetFromJsonAsync<List<Shipment>>(url) ?? [];
    }

    public async Task<Shipment?> GetShipmentByTrackingNumberAsync(string trackingNumber) =>
        await _http.GetFromJsonAsync<Shipment?>($"api/shipments/track/{trackingNumber}");

    public async Task UpdateShipmentStatusAsync(int id, ShipmentStatus newStatus) =>
        await _http.PutAsJsonAsync($"api/shipments/{id}/status", newStatus);
}
```

### 4. Create server-side service with seed data

Create `ShipmentTracker/Services/ServerShipmentService.cs`:
```csharp
using ShipmentTracker.Client.Models;
using ShipmentTracker.Client.Services;

namespace ShipmentTracker.Services;

public class ServerShipmentService : IShipmentService
{
    private static readonly List<Shipment> _shipments = new()
    {
        new() { Id = 1, TrackingNumber = "TRK-1001", Origin = "New York, US", Destination = "London, UK", Status = ShipmentStatus.InTransit, ShippedDate = DateTime.UtcNow.AddDays(-3), EstimatedDelivery = DateTime.UtcNow.AddDays(4), RecipientName = "Alice Johnson", CarrierName = "OceanFreight Co.", WeightKg = 12.5 },
        new() { Id = 2, TrackingNumber = "TRK-1002", Origin = "Shanghai, CN", Destination = "Los Angeles, US", Status = ShipmentStatus.Pending, ShippedDate = DateTime.UtcNow.AddDays(-1), EstimatedDelivery = DateTime.UtcNow.AddDays(12), RecipientName = "Bob Smith", CarrierName = "Pacific Logistics", WeightKg = 45.0 },
        new() { Id = 3, TrackingNumber = "TRK-1003", Origin = "Berlin, DE", Destination = "Tokyo, JP", Status = ShipmentStatus.OutForDelivery, ShippedDate = DateTime.UtcNow.AddDays(-7), EstimatedDelivery = DateTime.UtcNow, RecipientName = "Yuki Tanaka", CarrierName = "EuroAsia Express", WeightKg = 3.2 },
        new() { Id = 4, TrackingNumber = "TRK-1004", Origin = "São Paulo, BR", Destination = "Miami, US", Status = ShipmentStatus.Delivered, ShippedDate = DateTime.UtcNow.AddDays(-10), EstimatedDelivery = DateTime.UtcNow.AddDays(-2), ActualDelivery = DateTime.UtcNow.AddDays(-3), RecipientName = "Carlos Rivera", CarrierName = "LatAm Cargo", WeightKg = 8.7 },
        new() { Id = 5, TrackingNumber = "TRK-1005", Origin = "Sydney, AU", Destination = "Dubai, AE", Status = ShipmentStatus.Delayed, ShippedDate = DateTime.UtcNow.AddDays(-5), EstimatedDelivery = DateTime.UtcNow.AddDays(3), RecipientName = "Fatima Al-Rashid", CarrierName = "Southern Cross Shipping", WeightKg = 22.1 },
        new() { Id = 6, TrackingNumber = "TRK-1006", Origin = "Mumbai, IN", Destination = "Nairobi, KE", Status = ShipmentStatus.PickedUp, ShippedDate = DateTime.UtcNow, EstimatedDelivery = DateTime.UtcNow.AddDays(8), RecipientName = "James Ochieng", CarrierName = "IndoAfrica Freight", WeightKg = 15.3 },
        new() { Id = 7, TrackingNumber = "TRK-1007", Origin = "Toronto, CA", Destination = "Mexico City, MX", Status = ShipmentStatus.InTransit, ShippedDate = DateTime.UtcNow.AddDays(-2), EstimatedDelivery = DateTime.UtcNow.AddDays(5), RecipientName = "Maria Garcia", CarrierName = "NorthSouth Logistics", WeightKg = 6.0 },
        new() { Id = 8, TrackingNumber = "TRK-1008", Origin = "Lagos, NG", Destination = "Paris, FR", Status = ShipmentStatus.InTransit, ShippedDate = DateTime.UtcNow.AddDays(-4), EstimatedDelivery = DateTime.UtcNow.AddDays(2), RecipientName = "Pierre Dubois", CarrierName = "TransAtlantic Express", WeightKg = 30.0 },
    };

    private static readonly Lock _lock = new();

    public Task<List<Shipment>> GetAllShipmentsAsync() =>
        Task.FromResult(_shipments.ToList());

    public Task<List<Shipment>> GetShipmentsByStatusAsync(ShipmentStatus? status)
    {
        var result = status.HasValue
            ? _shipments.Where(s => s.Status == status.Value).ToList()
            : _shipments.ToList();
        return Task.FromResult(result);
    }

    public Task<Shipment?> GetShipmentByTrackingNumberAsync(string trackingNumber) =>
        Task.FromResult(_shipments.FirstOrDefault(s =>
            s.TrackingNumber.Equals(trackingNumber, StringComparison.OrdinalIgnoreCase)));

    public Task UpdateShipmentStatusAsync(int id, ShipmentStatus newStatus)
    {
        lock (_lock)
        {
            var shipment = _shipments.FirstOrDefault(s => s.Id == id);
            if (shipment is not null)
            {
                shipment.Status = newStatus;
                if (newStatus == ShipmentStatus.Delivered)
                    shipment.ActualDelivery = DateTime.UtcNow;
            }
        }
        return Task.CompletedTask;
    }
}
```

### 5. Create API endpoints on the server

Create `ShipmentTracker/Endpoints/ShipmentEndpoints.cs`:
```csharp
using ShipmentTracker.Client.Models;
using ShipmentTracker.Client.Services;

namespace ShipmentTracker.Endpoints;

public static class ShipmentEndpoints
{
    public static void MapShipmentEndpoints(this WebApplication app)
    {
        var group = app.MapGroup("api/shipments").RequireAuthorization();

        group.MapGet("", async (ShipmentStatus? status, IShipmentService service) =>
            await service.GetShipmentsByStatusAsync(status));

        group.MapGet("track/{trackingNumber}", async (string trackingNumber, IShipmentService service) =>
        {
            var shipment = await service.GetShipmentByTrackingNumberAsync(trackingNumber);
            return shipment is not null ? Results.Ok(shipment) : Results.NotFound();
        });

        group.MapPut("{id:int}/status", async (int id, ShipmentStatus newStatus, IShipmentService service) =>
        {
            await service.UpdateShipmentStatusAsync(id, newStatus);
            return Results.NoContent();
        });
    }
}
```

### 6. Update Server Program.cs

Edit `ShipmentTracker/Program.cs` to:
- Add `using ShipmentTracker.Client.Services;` and `using ShipmentTracker.Services;` and `using ShipmentTracker.Endpoints;`
- Register `builder.Services.AddSingleton<IShipmentService, ServerShipmentService>();` after the existing service registrations (before `var app = builder.Build();`)
- Add `app.MapShipmentEndpoints();` right before `app.MapAdditionalIdentityEndpoints();`

### 7. Update Client Program.cs

Edit `ShipmentTracker.Client/Program.cs` to register the HttpClient and ShipmentService:
```csharp
using Microsoft.AspNetCore.Components.WebAssembly.Hosting;
using ShipmentTracker.Client.Services;

var builder = WebAssemblyHostBuilder.CreateDefault(args);

builder.Services.AddAuthorizationCore();
builder.Services.AddCascadingAuthenticationState();
builder.Services.AddAuthenticationStateDeserialization();

builder.Services.AddScoped(sp =>
    new HttpClient { BaseAddress = new Uri(builder.HostEnvironment.BaseAddress) });
builder.Services.AddScoped<IShipmentService, ShipmentService>();

await builder.Build().RunAsync();
```

### 8. Create Dashboard page (Dispatcher view)

Create `ShipmentTracker.Client/Pages/Dashboard.razor`:
```razor
@page "/dashboard"
@using ShipmentTracker.Client.Models
@using ShipmentTracker.Client.Services
@attribute [Microsoft.AspNetCore.Authorization.Authorize]
@inject IShipmentService ShipmentService

<PageTitle>Dispatcher Dashboard</PageTitle>

<h1>Dispatcher Dashboard</h1>

<div class="row mb-3">
    <div class="col-md-4">
        <label class="form-label">Filter by Status</label>
        <select class="form-select" @bind="selectedStatus" @bind:after="LoadShipments">
            <option value="">All Statuses</option>
            @foreach (var status in Enum.GetValues<ShipmentStatus>())
            {
                <option value="@status">@status</option>
            }
        </select>
    </div>
    <div class="col-md-4">
        <label class="form-label">Search</label>
