## Requirements
- Dispatchers view a list of shipments with status and destination
- Customers check their shipment status and estimated delivery
- Every page has interactive controls
- Authentication is already scaffolded (ASP.NET Core Identity)

## Architecture (WebAssembly Global)
Since this is WebAssembly global mode:
- All interactive components MUST go in the `.Client` project
- Data access from components goes through HttpClient → server API endpoints
- Define interfaces in `.Client`, implement with HttpClient in `.Client`, implement with direct data in server
